{"title":"10 ft Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Grandeur of 10-Foot Artificial Christmas Trees\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMake a statement this holiday season with our stunning collection of 10-foot artificial Christmas trees. At King of Christmas, we understand that some spaces require a tree that goes beyond the ordinary. Our 10-foot trees are designed to fill large rooms with festive cheer, creating a breathtaking focal point that embodies the spirit of the season. Whether you're decorating a grand living room, a corporate space, or a commercial venue, our 10-foot trees are the perfect choice for those who want to celebrate Christmas in a big way.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eImpressive Designs for a Majestic Holiday Display\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur 10-foot artificial Christmas trees are available in a range of styles, from classic green to snowy flocked options. Each tree is meticulously crafted from high-quality, fire-resistant PVC and PE materials, ensuring a realistic appearance and durability that lasts for many holiday seasons. These trees offer the ideal combination of height, fullness, and beauty, making them a spectacular addition to any large space.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEasy Assembly and Secure Setup\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDespite their impressive size, our 10-foot trees are designed for easy assembly. With hinged branches and a sturdy metal stand, setting up your tree is a straightforward process. We also provide clear instructions to help you secure and shape your tree to perfection, so you can enjoy a stress-free holiday decorating experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMake Your Holidays Unforgettable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA 10-foot Christmas tree from King of Christmas is more than just a decoration—it’s an experience. These towering trees create a festive atmosphere that will be remembered for years to come. Perfect for making a grand impression, our 10-foot trees are the ultimate centerpiece for your holiday celebrations. Explore our collection and find the tree that will make your holiday season truly unforgettable.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"10-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"10' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 750 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642896707648,"sku":"PF-T10-L","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_5024a958-646c-4413-8cbb-72107e8ba72d_1.jpg?v=1761241980"},{"product_id":"10-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"10' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 1300 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642900377664,"sku":"QF-T10-L","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_8290f7cc-4dda-4d7d-bfbf-bc58b0b18dbc.jpg?v=1722012625"},{"product_id":"10-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-led","title":"10' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 1000 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642902573120,"sku":"KFS-T10-L","price":1099.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlockSlim_b8d17273-08da-471b-ad66-a17709fa274d.jpg?v=1714673456"},{"product_id":"10-foot-king-flock-tree-led","title":"10' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 1250 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642906243136,"sku":"KF-T10-L","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlock.jpg?v=1714673347"},{"product_id":"10-foot-king-douglas-fir-slim-tree-unlit","title":"10' King Douglas Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eInspired by the natural elegance of a real Douglas Fir, the King Douglas Fir features lifelike needles and a graceful, slender silhouette. Handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, Designed for realism and effortless upkeep, it fills your home with the spirit of the season and becomes a cherished centerpiece for holiday celebrations year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":32879328395341,"sku":"KDFS-T10-U","price":699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-9_bb37a48f-ec61-440d-8240-117b6d78d572.jpg?v=1718158060"},{"product_id":"10-foot-king-douglas-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"10' King Douglas Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 1200 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eInspired by the natural elegance of a real Douglas Fir, the King Douglas Fir features lifelike needles and a graceful, slender silhouette. Handcrafted with meticulous attention to detail, Designed for realism and effortless upkeep, it fills your home with the spirit of the season and becomes a cherished centerpiece for holiday celebrations year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642933440576,"sku":"KDFS-T10-L","price":999.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingDouglasFirSlim_b6ee2028-b2be-4aa7-b263-477f086b3c1c.jpg?v=1783959840"},{"product_id":"10-foot-royal-fir-tree-led","title":"10' Royal Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 1600 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28997011046464,"sku":"RF-T10-L","price":1899.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RoyalFir_59c675e2-b8a7-4062-af58-098f2e9b8021.png?v=1722013217"},{"product_id":"10-foot-alpine-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"10' Alpine Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree 1000 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eHandcrafted for lifelike realism, each branch mirrors the natural growth, color, and texture of a real Alpine Fir, native to the Washington state region. Enjoy festive charm without watering or needle cleanup, and bring the magic of a mountain-inspired Christmas into your home with ease.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":41323779424456,"sku":"AFG-ST-10-L","price":1149.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/AlpineFirSlimLED.jpg?v=1723213364"},{"product_id":"10-foot-queen-flock-tree-unlit","title":"10' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":41324700664008,"sku":"QF-T10-U","price":999.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-5_9ef11c71-64ab-4a00-9891-2b70b338751f.jpg?v=1718158243"},{"product_id":"10-foot-king-fraser-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"10' King Fraser Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 1100 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the holiday season with the natural splendor of the Appalachian Mountains brought right into your home with the King Fraser Fir. Designed to mirror the majestic Fraser Fir, its lush foliage and classic conical shape really captures the authenticity of a real tree. Find the perfect size for your space and enjoy a holiday season full of lifelike charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":41352442970312,"sku":"KFFS-T10-L","price":1099.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFraserFirSlim.jpg?v=1786731058"},{"product_id":"10-foot-king-fraser-fir-tree-led","title":"10' King Fraser Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 2100 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the holiday season with the natural splendor of the Appalachian Mountains brought right into your home with the King Fraser Fir. Designed to mirror the majestic Fraser Fir, its lush foliage and classic conical shape really captures the authenticity of a real tree. Find the perfect size for your space and enjoy a holiday season full of lifelike charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":41393532403912,"sku":"KFF-T10-L","price":1999.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/King-Fraser-Fir-Full-v2.jpg?v=1718157916"},{"product_id":"10-foot-royal-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"10' Royal Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 1500 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":41400037474504,"sku":"RFS-T10-L","price":1599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Royal-Fir-Slim-v2.jpg?v=1722013074"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/king-flock-artificial-christmas-trees_ccf15daf-7b6d-4ba9-8a59-665774099432.jpg?v=1666795567","url":"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/10-foot-artificial-christmas-trees.oembed","provider":"King of Christmas","version":"1.0","type":"link"}